Xiaomi is coming in strongly with their new v2.5 and v2.5 Pro models, which are MIT-licensed and natively multimodal.

The MiMo-V2.5-Pro is built for complex agent and coding tasks, ranking No. 1 among open-source models on GDPVal-AA and ClawEval. The MiMo-V2.5 is a native omni-modal model with strong agent capabilities. A model's value isn't measured by rankings alone — it's measured by the problems it solves. Let's build with MiMo now!

@XiaomiMiMo: "Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5 is now officially open-sourced! MIT License, supporting commercial deployment, continued training, and fine-tuning - no additional authorization required. Both models support a 1M-token context window."

