clean_summary:
Reminder: every Hugging Face Space is an API your agents can call. Nathan asked his agent to build a website about the flowers of France, which used VAST AI's TripoSplat Space to turn photos into real 3D Gaussian splats live on the page. This was done using his HF Pro daily ZeroGPU credits, which cost only $9 per month for 40 minutes of GPU time daily.

A demo is available on Hugging Face: TripoSplat, a Space by VAST-AI, lets users upload a 2D picture and converts it into a 3D model made of Gaussian points. Users can tweak settings, view the result in a web viewer, and download the model as a PLY or other formats.

@victormustar: "Cool demo available on Hugging Face."

